    [*] --> Opening
    Opening --> Clean : loaded, base_generation = G0
    Opening --> LoadFailed : network or server error
    LoadFailed --> Opening : reopen

    Clean --> Dirty : you change something
    Dirty --> Dirty : more edits, undo, redo
    Dirty --> Clean : undo back to saved
    Dirty --> ExitDialog : tap back
    ExitDialog --> Saving : Save and exit
    ExitDialog --> [*] : Discard changes
    ExitDialog --> Dirty : Stay
    Dirty --> LostOnKill : app killed or evicted

    Dirty --> Saving : tap Save, sends base_generation G
    Saving --> Saving : 2nd Save or Save and exit ignored
    Saving --> SavedEmpty : empty edit saved
    Saving --> PreviewPending : commit OK, new generation G1
    Saving --> OnDevice : commit OK, phone renders G1
    Saving --> RenderNotStarted : commit OK, render not queued
    Saving --> Conflict : 409 baseline_conflict, G is stale
    Saving --> ConflictLoop : 409 cancelled or 1st render running
    Saving --> SaveFailed : 422 timeline/device, 503, offline
    Saving --> Clean : song was already removed (5744)
    Saving --> NewJobIgnored : re-plan job arrives mid-save
    Saving --> SaveOrphaned : Switch tapped (prompt was up)
    SavedEmpty --> Clean : done

    PreviewPending --> Ready : variant ready for G1
    PreviewPending --> RenderFailed : variant failed for G1
    PreviewPending --> PreviewTimeout : 5 min, no answer
    PreviewPending --> PreviewNeverMatches : server moved to G2
    PreviewPending --> Dirty : you edit while it renders
    PreviewNeverMatches --> PreviewNeverMatches : Check preview again
    PreviewNeverMatches --> Dirty : you edit again (Save gets 409)
    PreviewTimeout --> PreviewPending : Check preview again
    OnDevice --> PreviewPending : phone published G1
    OnDevice --> DeviceRetry : phone needs attention or stopped
    DeviceRetry --> OnDevice : Retry, new render identity

    Ready --> Clean : player swaps to new video
    RenderNotStarted --> Saving : Retry render, same lanes
    RenderFailed --> Saving : Retry render, same lanes

    Conflict --> Rebasing : Reload latest and keep my edits
    Rebasing --> Dirty : latest is G2, your lanes on top
    Rebasing --> LaneOverwritten : same lane changed elsewhere
    LaneOverwritten --> Dirty : looks normal to you
    Rebasing --> SaveFailed : could not load latest
    ConflictLoop --> Rebasing : Reload, then Save again

    SaveFailed --> Saving : tap Save again

    Clean --> Opening : re-plan made a new job
    Dirty --> NewerJobPrompt : re-plan made a new job
    NewerJobPrompt --> Opening : Switch, unsaved edits dropped
    NewerJobPrompt --> Dirty : Keep editing
    Dirty --> OldJobLoop : Save after Keep editing
    OldJobLoop --> Rebasing : Reload reads the old job again
    OldJobLoop --> NewerJobPrompt : next sync asks again
    NewJobIgnored --> Dirty : no retry until next sync
    NewJobIgnored --> OldJobLoop : save hit the new job, 409
    SaveOrphaned --> Opening : new job loads

    Clean --> RefreshFailed : chat sync failed
    Dirty --> RefreshFailed : chat sync failed
    Dirty --> Conflict : chat edit hits your lane (1835)
    RefreshFailed --> Dirty : next sync works

